      "side": 1,
      "message": "Splitting the line here to avoid going over the 80-character limit.\n\nI\u0027ve tested that the sequence \u003cbackslash\u003e\u003cnewline\u003e\u003ctab\u003e\u003crparen\u003e results in the string we want (that is, nothing between the output of `clang --print-resource-dir` and the `/lib/...` string).\n\n`:\u003d` is used here so that the shell command is evaluated immediately, which is necessary to make the check on `$(.SHELLSTATUS)` work (with `\u003d`, the shell is not invoked until later, so the value of `$(.SHELLSTATUS)` on the next line does not reflect whether or not that invocation would actually succeed).",
      "revId": "4242082cc9d256fe1545a8fc1ed2e7594b3ec0c8",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
